  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IWN/216",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>행복한&#160;가정은&#160;모두&#160;비슷하게&#160;닮았지만, </b><br><b>불행한&#160;가정은&#160;저마다의&#160;이유로&#160;불행하다.</b> <br>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;-톨스토이의 &#39;안나 카레니나&#39;-<br>&#160;<br>이 관점을&#160;<br>제레미 레프킨의 &#39;총균쇠&#39;에서는&#160;<br>선택화된 가축화와 &#39;안나 카레니나의 법칙&#39; 이라는 개념으로<br>재해석했습니다.<br>&#160;수많은 생물 종들 중에<br>단지 몇 종만 가축화에 성공한 이유는<br>아주 다양한 조건들을 모두 만족해야 하기 때문입니다.<br>...<br>&#160;<br>그런데<br>인간관계에서<br>행복을 위한 모든 조건을 완벽하게 갖추는 것이 가능할까요?<br>&#160;<br>그럼<br>행복을 위해 무엇이 필요할까요?<br>&#160;<br>바로<br>구성원들이 함께 행복해지기 위한&#160;<br>의도적인 &#39;노력&#39;이 중요하다고 생각합니다.<br>&#160;<br>그래서&#160;<br>&#39;노력&#39;의 의미를 담아 카드를 만들어보았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fef3a9db2b05cb4ac4df0c41702c8e1af036a228\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"536\" height=\"460\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fef3a9db2b05cb4ac4df0c41702c8e1af036a228\" data-origin-width=\"751\" data-origin-height=\"645\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>이런 의미를 담아<br>행복한 가정을 위한 10계명도 만들어봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c2f78f1a5c43e25097646330d1c411f1bf0c621a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"466\" height=\"734\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c2f78f1a5c43e25097646330d1c411f1bf0c621a\" data-origin-width=\"419\" data-origin-height=\"660\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>--------------------------<br>이번에는&#160;<br>행복한 교직문화를 위한 내용으로&#160;<br>응용해보았습니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db504c582fdf5d3dc6b9c03681fff956e38160c7\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"507\" height=\"416\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db504c582fdf5d3dc6b9c03681fff956e38160c7\" data-origin-width=\"749\" data-origin-height=\"614\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35d46c83b6b27b93505145f6cf523f0987534f8c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35d46c83b6b27b93505145f6cf523f0987534f8c\" data-origin-width=\"432\" data-origin-height=\"686\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>오늘도<br>재과만에서<br>함께 행복하세요~<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
